# UPGRADE-21
# Durable Autonomous Engineering Runtime
#
# Real Git Worktrees
# Durable SQLite/PostgreSQL Task State
# Multi-Process Workers
# Crash / Restart Recovery
# Idempotent Commit / Push / PR Operations
# CI Discovery & CI State Persistence
# Real Local Model Evidence
# Optional Real GitHub Sandbox Verification
#
# PRIMARY PRINCIPLES
#
# NO-COST FIRST
# LOCAL-FIRST
# DURABLE STATE > IN-MEMORY STATE
# REAL GIT > WORKTREE SIMULATION
# RESTART MUST NOT DUPLICATE SIDE EFFECTS
# NO SILENT PUSH
# NO SILENT MERGE
# NO SILENT PAID FALLBACK
# EVIDENCE MUST MATCH EXECUTION

You are operating directly inside ZCoder after Upgrade-20.

================================================================
MISSION
================================================================

Upgrade-20 proved the autonomous engineering state machine at E3 using
deterministic/system simulations.

Upgrade-21 must convert the critical execution path from:

IN-MEMORY / SIMULATED

to:

DURABLE / REAL LOCAL SYSTEM

Target:

EngineeringTask
       │
       ▼
 Durable Task Store
 SQLite / PostgreSQL
       │
       ▼
 Durable Attempt
       │
       ▼
 Real Git Repository
       │
       ▼
 git worktree add
       │
       ▼
 Actual filesystem edits
       │
       ▼
 Actual validators
       │
       ▼
 Actual git commit
       │
       ▼
 Restart / Resume
       │
       ▼
 Same task / same worktree / same commit
       │
       ▼
 Optional Push
       │
       ▼
 Optional GitHub PR
       │
       ▼
 Optional CI Observation

Upgrade-21 succeeds only when restarting ZCoder does not cause:

- lost engineering tasks
- lost checkpoints
- duplicate worktrees
- duplicate commits
- duplicate pushes
- duplicate pull requests
- duplicate CI repair attempts

