================================================================
157. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-21 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-20 durability claims are corrected
[ ] durable EngineeringStore exists
[ ] SQLite is default durable local store
[ ] PostgreSQL implementation uses existing tenancy model
[ ] tasks survive process restart
[ ] attempts survive restart
[ ] checkpoints survive restart
[ ] approvals survive restart
[ ] cancellations survive restart
[ ] retry history survives restart
[ ] hard crash is tested with separate process
[ ] real Git repository is exercised
[ ] actual git worktree is exercised
[ ] primary workspace remains unchanged
[ ] worktree reconciliation works after restart
[ ] real validator fail->pass is executed
[ ] actual Git diff feeds review
[ ] actual commit is created
[ ] commit crash window is reconciled
[ ] local bare remote push is real
[ ] push crash window is reconciled
[ ] external-operation journal exists
[ ] unknown operation state triggers reconcile, not blind retry
[ ] CI discovery is implemented
[ ] CI repair budgets persist
[ ] CONFIG_MERGE gap is closed
[ ] DRIFT_DETECTION gap is closed
[ ] MCP_TRUST gap is closed
[ ] multi-process task claiming is safe
[ ] stale worker cannot mutate remote state
[ ] GitHub remains optional
[ ] no-cost local engineering requires no cloud account
[ ] real local model evidence remains separately classified
[ ] real GitHub evidence remains separately classified
[ ] inherited RLS/security/runtime gates remain green

