## 37. Final Verdict

Never call:

CHECKPOINT RECOVERY DURABLE

when checkpoints only exist in RAM.

Never call:

REAL GIT WORKTREE VERIFIED

without actual git worktree execution.

Never call:

LOCAL ENGINEERING VERIFIED

because FakeLocalModel modified a fixture.

Never call:

PR AUTOMATION VERIFIED

because FakeGitHub returned a fake PR number.

Never blindly repeat push/PR after an UNKNOWN side-effect state.

Reconcile first.

Upgrade-21 succeeds when an autonomous engineering task can survive the
death of the ZCoder process and continue from durable state against a
real Git repository without duplicating commits or remote mutations.